    /// allocated object.
    /// * Both `start` and `end` must be _derived from_ a pointer to the same
    /// object.
    /// * The distance between `start` and `end` must not overflow `isize`.
    /// * The distance being in bounds must not rely on "wrapping around" the
    /// address space.
